# Harness self-improvement loop: signal is local and noisy, wisdom is committed.
.harness/ledger.jsonl

# Build-time embeddings. One file per distinct text, ~12KB each, so the default
# corpus is ~94MB: derivable from fixtures/config.json plus a model call, and not
# something to carry in git. fixtures/manifest.json is committed instead, because
# it is small and it is what the harness actually reads.
fixtures/cache/
